[gd_scene load_steps=7 format=3]

; The Veena of the Vale. Its long axis is local Y and its origin is where a
; hand holds the neck, so the one scene lies across the stand
; (scenes/quest/TowerTop.tscn) and hangs from the player's hand
; (Player.tscn carryables, flag carrying_veena).
; PLACEHOLDER: a timber neck, a round gourd and a small one, dark strings;
; replaced by the custom Veena of GDD §10. Its strings turn peacock blue only
; at beat 12, outside the slice, so nothing here is blue.

